# Rust
target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally committed. These are deployable contracts,
# not a library published to crates.io, so builds must be reproducible.
# It is also load-bearing: soroban-env-host 23.0.1 declares
# `ed25519-dalek = ">=2.0.0"` but only compiles against 2.x, so an unpinned
# resolve picks 3.0.0 and fails to build.

